    {k="c", q=2078, oi=1, m=1439, x=56.65, y=13.48, t="Gyromast's Revenge", obj="Escort The Threshwackonator 4100 to Gelkak Gyromast Kill The Threshwackonator 4100 once it turns hostile This quest is VERY difficult Try to do this quest if you can as it'll save you time later as it rewards [Elixirs of Water Breathing] for underwater quests later Use [Entangling Roots] on him when he turns hostile then create distance and kite using instant cast spells If you are unable to kill the The Threshwackonator 4100, skip this step", pre={2078}, el=18},
